    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i feel completely normal right now. if it was something serious like a stroke wouldn't i still be feeling it? it went away so fast i feel like it was just a weird glitch or something. i dont really want to sit in an ER for 6 hours if it's just nothing. can i just keep an eye on it for a few days and see if it happens again?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
